  "negative_control": "Only builtin bridge source comes from 54b; candidate platform/probe/stub stay unchanged; all three cases abort at active-callback/devres assertion, not compilation or timeout.",
  "of_resource_flags_resolution": "This local of_iomap has no separate MEM check; default OF translation always uses IORESOURCE_MEM; target simple-bus memory resources match the reviewed ranges.",
  "boundaries": [
    "No production changes or ADB/device execution.",
    "Serialized WMT owner and fixed already enumerated target device; no automatic deferred reprobe guarantee.",
    "Other IC private resources and optional runtime-PM/dedicated-log/DEVAPC/reset callbacks excluded.",
    "Host payload/resource/provider adapters do not model hardware MMIO, real thermal commands, EMI-MPU restoration, scheduler or runtime power-off.",
    "Root-owned platform/callback regression and seven ARM64-unit compilation results are separate and were not repeated."
  ]
